  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぼたん",
    "text": "「お～い、転校生くん。だいぶ遅れてるけど、大丈夫？　やっぱり荷物、運ぶの手伝おうか？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぼたん",
    "text": "「ごめんね。わたしたちのぶんまで、旅行鞄とか運んでもらっちゃって」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 56,
    "dress": "old-w-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぼたん",
    "text": "「というか……ありがとうね、付きあってくれて」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぼたん",
    "text": "「せっかくの、冬休みなのに。他に、予定とかあったんじゃない？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぼたん",
    "text": "「いっしょに福引きで当てた温泉旅館の宿泊券、ちょっと持て余してたからさ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぼたん",
    "text": "「金券ショップとかで、売っ払っちゃおうかなぁと思ってたんだけど」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 56,
    "dress": "old-w-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w-civvies_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぼたん",
    "text": "「桃智さんが、もったいないし『せっかく』だし……。とか、うるさいからさ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 56,
    "dress": "old-w-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぼたん",
    "text": "「こうして、寒いなか温泉旅館にきたわけだけど」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぼたん",
    "text": "「わたしだけのちからで引き当てた賞品じゃないし、転校生くんも誘うのが『すじ』だよね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 56,
    "dress": "old-w-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w-civvies_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぼたん",
    "text": "「そう思ったんだけど、迷惑だったならごめんね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 56,
    "dress": "old-w-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぼたん",
    "text": "「三人まで、無料ってことだからさ。わたしと、転校生くんと……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぼたん",
    "text": "「まぁあの子が福引きのボランティアしてたのも何かの縁だし、ついでに桃智さんもね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぼたん",
    "text": "「ちょっと珍しいというか、不思議な取りあわせだよね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 56,
    "dress": "old-w-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w-civvies_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぼたん",
    "text": "「転校生くんも、あんまりよく知らない上級生によく『ほいほい』ついてくるなぁ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 56,
    "dress": "old-w-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w-civvies_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぼたん",
    "text": "「わたしとしては、わざわざお風呂に入るために山とか登るの面倒だなぁ……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 56,
    "dress": "old-w-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぼたん",
    "text": "「って感じだったんだけど、どうもこの旅館は温泉饅頭が有名らしいんだよね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぼたん",
    "text": "「聞いた話によると、ここ円城寺さんが経営してるらしいんだ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぼたん",
    "text": "「わたし、それなりに仲良しだから知ってるんだけど。円城寺さんは、何にでも無駄にお金かけるから」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 56,
    "dress": "old-w-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぼたん",
    "text": "「きっと、噂の温泉饅頭も素晴らしい美味にちがいない……♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
